// The SafeGo compiler intrinsics, published as pkg.safego.dev/rt.
//
// This tree is a nested module inside the compiler repository, not a copy of one: the
// compiler and the intrinsics it lowers are versioned together (Spec 012 D6), and the
// release job publishes this directory to github.com/golang-safe/rt at the matching tag.
module pkg.safego.dev/rt

go 1.26.2
